WEBVTT

00:00:08.596 --> 00:00:11.068
Dragon Warrior.
神龙大侠 乌龟

00:00:11.092 --> 00:00:12.992
Oogway? Whoa!
神龙大侠 乌龟

00:00:13.035 --> 00:00:14.428
[PO GRUNTING]

00:00:15.864 --> 00:00:17.474
[GASPS]
I can't believe it.
不会吧 简直跟做梦一样

00:00:17.518 --> 00:00:19.085
[CHUCKLES] Whoa!

00:00:19.128 --> 00:00:20.564
You are extra shiny.
你可比以前更精神啦

00:00:20.608 --> 00:00:22.044
As are you.
你也是 是吧 我这件披风超棒的

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:24.003
I know, right?
It's like the best cape ever.
你也是 是吧 我这件披风超棒的

00:00:24.046 --> 00:00:26.353
When I run with it,
then it looks really cool.
我穿着它跑起来的时候很帅

00:00:26.396 --> 00:00:28.790
It suits you.
You've grown.
你穿着很合身 你长大啦

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:30.574
Yep. I gotta lay off
the panda buffet.
是吧 其实也没长大 就是吃胖了

00:00:30.618 --> 00:00:32.315
Grown up...
[LAUGHING]
你成熟了

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.101
as I hoped you would
正如我通知你父亲时所期望的那样

00:00:35.144 --> 00:00:37.763
when I sent the message
to your father.
正如我通知你父亲时所期望的那样

00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:40.921
[GASPS] You sent
the universe mail. Whoa!
原来那条来自宇宙的消息是你发的 哇

00:00:40.976 --> 00:00:42.717
Yes.
对 因为宇宙需要你

00:00:42.761 --> 00:00:45.372
Because the universe
needed you.
对 因为宇宙需要你

00:00:45.415 --> 00:00:48.158
Me? [CHUCKLES]
我

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:52.509
You finally became the panda
you were always meant to be.
你终于成为了命中注定的那只熊猫

00:00:52.553 --> 00:00:54.686
But, how'd you know
I could?
可你怎么知道我能做到呢

00:00:54.729 --> 00:00:57.297
On the first day
we met...
在我们初次见面的那天

00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:00.419
I saw the future
of kung fu.
我看到了功夫的未来

00:01:02.824 --> 00:01:04.434
And the past.
以及过去

00:01:07.699 --> 00:01:10.789
I saw the panda
who could unite them both.
我看到了一只能将两者合二为一的熊猫

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:14.392
That is why I chose you, Po.
所以我才选择了你 阿宝

00:01:14.749 --> 00:01:18.014
Both sides of
a Yin and Yang.
你结合了阴阳两面

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:22.409
And my true successor.
也是我真正的继承人

00:01:24.846 --> 00:01:27.614
Me? I can't take that.
我 这我不能要

00:01:27.697 --> 00:01:29.372
Just take it.
你就拿着吧 我还有个更大的

00:01:29.416 --> 00:01:30.620
[WHISPERING]
I have a bigger one.
你就拿着吧 我还有个更大的

00:01:32.941 --> 00:01:35.727
I mean, you're enlightened
and everything. I'm just...
我是说 您都已经开悟了 而我

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:38.120
[GASPS] Oh!
我是说 您都已经开悟了 而我

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:39.252
Really?
真的吗

00:01:39.295 --> 00:01:40.514
Yes.
是

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:44.997
[YELLING]

00:01:46.738 --> 00:01:47.826
[CHUCKLING]

00:01:48.609 --> 00:01:50.089
[CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY]

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:52.569
Now what do we do?
我们现在怎么办

00:01:52.613 --> 00:01:54.981
Hmm. You tell me.
你说呢

00:01:55.877 --> 00:01:57.966
No. Oogway, don't go!
不 乌龟 你别走

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:01.317
I'm not going anywhere.
I live here.
我哪儿都不去 我就住这儿

00:02:01.361 --> 00:02:02.942
Oh, right.
哦 好吧

00:02:04.277 --> 00:02:07.541
It's you who must decide
whether to stay or go.
要决定去留的是你自己

00:02:08.194 --> 00:02:10.370
Wait. I can go back?
什么 我还能回去

00:02:10.413 --> 00:02:12.851
Who knows?
I've never tried.
谁知道呢 我从来没试过

00:02:27.474 --> 00:02:28.784
Wow!
哇

00:02:31.826 --> 00:02:33.262
[PANDAS GASPING]

00:02:37.136 --> 00:02:38.311
[ALL CHEERING]

00:02:39.616 --> 00:02:41.749
Po!Oh!
儿子

00:02:41.793 --> 00:02:43.795
You can fly! Oh!
你会飞啦

00:02:43.838 --> 00:02:45.666
[PANDAS LAUGHING]
你会飞啦

00:02:46.232 --> 00:02:47.522
[SCREAMING]

00:02:49.452 --> 00:02:51.271
Dad. Dad.
老爸 老爸 老爸们

00:02:51.333 --> 00:02:52.528
Dads!
老爸 老爸 老爸们

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:53.919
BOTH: Son!
儿子

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.330
[LI LAUGHING]
儿子

00:02:56.938 --> 00:02:59.826
Don't you go disappearing
in petals ever again.
以后可不许钻花瓣里玩消失了啊

00:02:59.839 --> 00:03:01.334
We thought we lost you.
我们还以为失去你了呢

00:03:01.377 --> 00:03:03.484
No, you saved me.
不 是你们救了我

00:03:04.163 --> 00:03:05.813
You all did.
是大家救了我

00:03:06.165 --> 00:03:07.383
[LAUGHING]
是大家救了我

00:03:07.427 --> 00:03:09.429
Now, come on over here!
大家快过来

00:03:09.472 --> 00:03:10.909
[ALL CHEERING] Hugs!
抱抱 耶

00:03:11.779 --> 00:03:13.085
[BIG FUN LAUGHING]
抱抱 耶

00:03:14.695 --> 00:03:16.740
Master Shifu!
师父

00:03:16.784 --> 00:03:19.743
The student has truly
become the tea...
学生终于修炼成了老师

00:03:19.787 --> 00:03:21.267
Wait. Where did you
get that?
等等 这是哪儿来的

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:24.464
Oh, this. Oogway gave it to me
in the Spirit Realm.
哦 这个吗 是乌龟在灵界传给我的

00:03:24.531 --> 00:03:26.576
Oh... Of course he did.
哦 这还用说嘛

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:28.274
I think I mastered chi.
我好像学会用气了

00:03:29.449 --> 00:03:30.537
[SIGHS]
哦 这还用说嘛

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:32.104
Of course you did.
哦 这还用说嘛

00:03:33.496 --> 00:03:35.411
Can you teach me?
你能教我吗

00:03:38.588 --> 00:03:39.894
Ready!
准备

00:03:39.938 --> 00:03:41.548
[ALL GRUNTING]
准备

00:03:41.591 --> 00:03:42.882
[KUNG FU FIGHTING PLAYING]

00:03:44.820 --> 00:03:45.987
[YELLS]

00:03:46.509 --> 00:03:47.554
[ALL YELL]

00:04:00.523 --> 00:04:01.655
Whoa!

00:04:01.698 --> 00:04:02.872
[GROANS]

00:04:03.787 --> 00:04:05.088
Ow!

00:04:05.572 --> 00:04:07.008
[ALL CHEERING]

00:04:08.662 --> 00:04:09.881
Monkey, help me! [LAUGHING]
金猴 快帮帮我

00:04:09.924 --> 00:04:11.839
Greeny Baby!
绿娃娃

00:04:11.883 --> 00:04:13.493
Get 'em off me!
[LEI LEI GIGGLES]
让他们放开我

00:04:14.711 --> 00:04:16.365
[YELLING]

00:04:16.409 --> 00:04:17.672
[LAUGHING]

00:04:18.715 --> 00:04:21.153
Mmm! Hello.
帅哥

00:04:21.196 --> 00:04:22.553
[WHOOPS]
帅哥

00:04:22.599 --> 00:04:23.677
[BOTH GRUNTING]

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:24.977
[CLUCKS]

00:04:27.942 --> 00:04:30.292
[CUBS LAUGHING]

00:04:31.598 --> 00:04:32.599
Skadoosh.
熊孩子

00:04:39.606 --> 00:04:42.217
[WHEEZING] Panda asthma.
熊猫哮喘又犯了

00:04:42.914 --> 00:04:44.367
[CHUCKLES]

